Cloudflare WARP Config Generator (MASQUE To Clash)

An independent implementation inspired by the option sets and configuration
structures of:

  https://m2c.pages.dev/
  https://masque.pages.dev/
  https://github.com/KJGX66F/usque-custom-pro

This project adds a self-deployable Cloudflare Worker relay so that a static
GitHub Pages site can register WARP devices and issue Clash subscriptions.
No source code was copied from the referenced projects.

